{"version":1,"key":"card:70","content":{"id":70,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"829aaf45-6699-4c9e-aadf-8de4770dbea1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"mkdir"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以创建一个空文件夹"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"bf455b4e-2e99-4238-bca8-d55f114c4c2b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"568c48c2-364c-4424-9ce4-e111732b8bfe","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 当前文件夹下什么也没有\n~ » ll\ntotal 0\n# 创建一个名为 dir 的空文件夹\n~ » mkdir dir\n~ » ll\ntotal 0\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 xt xt 4.0K Dec  2 21:09 dir\n# 查看 dir 中的内容，没有任何东西，是个空文件夹\n~ » ls dir","collabId":"cc06a83f-28bc-4f90-a7e0-7b36a73b2ab4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e20db5dc-0dcc-4775-884b-a7f6b9496cff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候我们想创建一个深层次的文件夹，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir1/dir2/dir3"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir1/dir2/"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 下创建 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir3"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们尝试使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"mkdir"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令进行创建"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"914f6ad8-300e-419d-bd85-a9a8da90ecc2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"386068ac-b5be-44ca-9b57-eb6d183bc94b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » mkdir dir1/dir2/dir3\nmkdir: cannot create directory ‘dir1/dir2/dir3’: No such file or directory","collabId":"a97e8340-dd5b-4ead-a316-41fa370e4592","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2aaef0b4-745a-41bf-a42a-1e000639eda0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是失败了，因为不存在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir1"},{"type":"formatted","text":"和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir1/dir2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这两个文件夹，所以无法创建 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir3"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以我们必须先创建 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir2"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后才能创建 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir3"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"07886bc2-0d0e-433b-80e8-b1f6abb49ced","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"30bac339-6d8f-4561-91ff-d915fccb3a5d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » mkdir dir1\n~ » mkdir dir1/dir2\n~ » mkdir dir1/dir2/dir3\n~ » tree .\n.\n├── dir\n└── dir1\n    └── dir2\n        └── dir3\n\n4 directories, 0 files","collabId":"8436a9ae-6dd6-4484-a549-d1c23da7cbe8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d82da229-120a-4f2c-b8df-cd1e5da7c623","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这样做虽然实现了目的，但是很累，我们可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-p"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项来创建文件夹，例如"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"539f092e-411f-4805-8e26-93153df04509","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ff38010f-f8ac-4687-86e2-decbf045a80c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » mkdir -p d1/d2/d3\n~ » tree\n.\n├── d1\n│   └── d2\n│       └── d3\n├── dir\n└── dir1\n    └── dir2\n        └── dir3\n\n7 directories, 0 files","collabId":"e59c198e-4cb3-4b4e-bf0f-19ea45b87b3f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"189c41c9-b158-4feb-ab5a-a31a533b5ba3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"添加了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-p"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项之后，如果我们要创建的文件夹的父级文件夹不存在，系统则会帮我们创建，也就是说 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"mkdir -p d1/d2/d3"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，虽然 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"d1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"d2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件夹不存在，但是系统会帮我们自动创建。"}]}],"tags":["Linux/命令/mkdir"],"createTime":1689087324435,"updateTime":1745155356076,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745155356076}}